  DISEASDESC01TEXT: `Broken legs leave citizens lying on the floor in pain.`,
  DISEASDESC02TEXT: `After a gestational period, a vicious monster bursts from its unfortunate host.`,
  DISEASDESC03TEXT: `A plague so terrifying deadly and infectious that entire planets have been blown up to prevent its spread.`,
  DISEASDESC04TEXT: `A deadly virus that kills extremely quickly. It doesn't spread very well though.`,
