  DISEASDESC06TEXT: `Leaves the citizen with low energy, and eventually results in death.`,
  DISEASDESC07TEXT: `There were rumors of a cure-all for colds before the entire galaxy collapsed, however, it never existed. Highly Contagious`,
  DISEASDESC08TEXT: `This character is unconscious, and will wake up in a little while.`,
  DISEASDESC09TEXT: `This character has dysentery.  Um, where's the bathroom?`,
  DISEASDESC11TEXT: `This character's skull has become cracked, likely through violent action, Ouch`,
