  DISEASDESC13TEXT: `This character's nose is bloodied and bleeding.`,
  DISEASDESC14TEXT: `A bacterial infection that makes those infected with it extremely antisocial and lazy, and extremely amused, by everything. It then kills them.`,
  DISEASDESC15TEXT: `A strange disease that makes those infected with it into workaholics, those infected would rather work then eat sleep or survive longer then a week.`,
  DISEASDESC16TEXT: `A disease that makes those who have it talk too much, very infectious.`,
  DISEASDESC17TEXT: `A disease that makes those infected with it unamused by pretty much anything, its also extremely infectious.`,
  DISEASDESC18TEXT: `A disease that makes those infected with it extremely sleepy, it is also quite infectious.`,
  DISEASDESC19TEXT: `A disease that makes those infected with it waste away slowly. Its origins are unknown, although it is feared throughout the galaxy. It is extremely infectious.`,
  DISEASDESC20TEXT: `A strange worm-like organism that burrows into its hosts brain and eventually exercises chemical based mind control. The infected think of nothing but spreading the worms progeny.`,
