  INVOBJ016TEXT: `Good all-around armor.`,
  INVOBJ017TEXT: `Strong armor that looks really cool.`,
  INVOBJ018TEXT: `Armored Vest`,
  INVOBJ019TEXT: `Dilapidated Vest`,
  INVOBJ020TEXT: `Full of holes, this may have provided good protection many fights ago.`,
  INVOBJ021TEXT: `Provides a light amount of protection.`,
  INVOBJ022TEXT: `Phazer Pistol`,
  INVOBJ023TEXT: `For causing intentional or unintentional damage to people, objects, and critical space-facing walls.`,
  INVOBJ024TEXT: `Megaphazer`,
  INVOBJ025TEXT: `Designed to exterminate organic life.`,
  INVOBJ026TEXT: `Phazer Rifle`,
  INVOBJ027TEXT: `More effective than the Phazer Pistol in the hands of trained personnel.`,
  INVOBJ028TEXT: `Stunner`,
  INVOBJ029TEXT: `Super Stunner`,
  INVOBJ030TEXT: `Hyper-Phaze Hand Cannon`,
  INVOBJ031TEXT: `Mk III Maintainenance Swarm Generator`,
  INVOBJ032TEXT: `Sonic Spork`,
  INVOBJ033TEXT: `Astro-Dust Vacuumatomizer`,
  INVOBJ034TEXT: `Mrs. Sunshine`,
  INVOBJ035TEXT: `Field Medical Kit`,
  INVOBJ036TEXT: `Cow Skull`,
  INVOBJ037TEXT: `Terran Globe`,
  INVOBJ038TEXT: `Garden Gnome`,
  INVOBJ039TEXT: `Lava Lamp`,
  INVOBJ040TEXT: `Cactus`,
  INVOBJ041TEXT: `Antique Clock`,
  INVOBJ042TEXT: `Baseball`,
  INVOBJ043TEXT: `Basketball`,
  INVOBJ044TEXT: `Candy Bucket`,
  INVOBJ046TEXT: `Old Terran Globe`,
  INVOBJ047TEXT: `Stone Head`,
  INVOBJ048TEXT: `Toy Spacebus`,
  INVOBJ049TEXT: `Music Box`,
  INVOBJ050TEXT: `Framed Photo`,
  INVOBJ051TEXT: `Toy Parasite`,
  INVOBJ052TEXT: `Action Figure`,
  INVOBJ053TEXT: `Wizard`,
  INVOBJ054TEXT: `Stuns target instead of killing it. Still kinda hurts though.`,
  INVOBJ055TEXT: `Stuns target more effectively. Will totally mess up your hairdo.`,
  INVOBJ056TEXT: `Damages the bejeepers out of any target. The pinnacle of Pre-Collapse weapons tech.`,
  INVOBJ057TEXT: `Maintains equipment and keeps it from degrading for a short while after. How? NANOMACHINES.`,
  INVOBJ058TEXT: `Builds stuff faster and better-lasting. Even a lousy builder is pretty decent with these things!`,
  INVOBJ059TEXT: `Less waste for each mined asteroid chunk = more matter.`,
  INVOBJ060TEXT: `Gentler on plants, more radiant energy transferred. Very catchy jingle in the old vids.`,
  INVOBJ061TEXT: `Much more accurate dianoses. For example, you will know within seconds if you are analyzing a fish or a person.`,
  INVOBJ062TEXT: `Old Terrans loved the number 12, and kept these blinking displays everywhere.`,
  INVOBJ063TEXT: `An ancient Terran sport that became even more popular after Terran-Jojaban first contact.`,
  INVOBJ064TEXT: `Originally created for an ancient Terran sport, several new sports using this same ball have sprung up.`,
  INVOBJ065TEXT: `Young sentients of all races use these to store concentrated glucose treats.`,
  INVOBJ066TEXT: `For some reason, the wastelands of Old Terra have lots of these lying around.`,
  INVOBJ067TEXT: `Yup, that's pretty much what it looks like these days.`,
  INVOBJ068TEXT: `This place used to be a weird blue marble! Then some mistakes happened. Whoops!`,
  INVOBJ069TEXT: `Rubbery bird companion! Floats in water and in hard vacuum.`,
  INVOBJ070TEXT: `Once exerting secret control of Terran politics, these beings left small monuments everywhere.`,
  INVOBJ071TEXT: `Better known these days as "skeleton heads".`,
  INVOBJ072TEXT: `Soft n' cuddly feline companion. Thalrassh find them deeply weird.`,
  INVOBJ073TEXT: `Old Terran mind expansion aid. Unfortunate resemblance to Quaaai burial urns.`,
  INVOBJ074TEXT: `Obnoxiously spiky plant lifeform. It is not ready to be loved.`,
  INVOBJ075TEXT: `Left around Terra as a practical joke by one of the Elder Races.`,
  INVOBJ076TEXT: `Cool, accurate replica. Action figures sold separately.`,
  INVOBJ077TEXT: `Container for warm liquids, vehicle for personal expression.`,
  INVOBJ078TEXT: `The spinning dancer and captivating tune appeals especially to sentimental types.`,
  INVOBJ079TEXT: `Distant ancestor of today's megapopular handheld game system. The games are actually cooler.`,
  INVOBJ080TEXT: `They call them "vidstills" these days, but that's goofy.`,
  INVOBJ081TEXT: `Lovely antique timekeeping device crafted by tiny elves.`,
  INVOBJ082TEXT: `What's inside? Nobody who's found out... HAS SURVIVED. Just kidding. It's a toy.`,
  INVOBJ083TEXT: `This device broadcasts the sounds of distant pulsars.`,
  INVOBJ084TEXT: `Fuzzy, squishy bear shaped object. Its gaze is said to be intense.`,
  INVOBJ085TEXT: `Adorable toy monster. Not based on any discovered lifeform, but maybe they're out there somewhere?`,
  INVOBJ086TEXT: `The ultimate in bouncing toy sphere technology.`,
  INVOBJ087TEXT: `Ha ha, it's funny because a real one could burst out of any of us at any moment!`,
  INVOBJ088TEXT: `Star Warrior Jill, a fav of kids across the galaxy. Very popular breakfast cereal tie-in.`,
  INVOBJ089TEXT: `Stellar Explorer Cody, more popular among older collectors. Jet pack breaks off way too easily.`,
  INVOBJ090TEXT: `An old long-forgotten creature preserved in stone.`,
  INVOBJ091TEXT: `Clearly a powerful beast, standing with dignity despite his age and attire.`,
  JB01: ` The Jukebox in /CURRENTROOM/ has every song I like on it!`,
  JB02: `Just listened to some pre-collapse tunes on the jukebox, nostalgia baby`,
  JB03: `I'm so glad the administrator saw it fit to get a jukebox put in  /CURRENTROOM/ without it I couldn't listen to my favorite music!`,
  JB04: `Just listening to tunes in /CURRENTROOM/ #Nightlife `,
  JB05: `This base has quite the nightlife, it reminds me of a Terran city!`,
  JB06: `Sliders, music and alcohol heck yeah!`,
  JB07: `You know its been awhile since I heard songs by /RANDOMBAND/ . `,
  JB08: `I was head-banging so hard from this song by /RANDOMBAND/ . `,
  JB09: `Loving the jukebox in /CURRENTROOM/ .`,
  JB10: `I could listen to songs all day in /CURRENTROOM/ but i suppose that would be unhealthy.`,
  JB11: `I would rather listen to songs in /CURRENTROOM/ then work but i would do alot of things to avoid work.`,
  JB12: `I'm not sure many of the aliens on this base are capable of appreciating the finer points of music from /RANDOMBAND/ but I listen to it anyway`,
  JB13: `This kind of music always brings me back! #/RANDOMBAND/ in #/CURRENTROOM/`,
  JUKEX001TEXT: `Jukebox`,
  JUKEX002TEXT: `The JamBand2000 is a state-of-the-art listening device.`,
  JUKEX003TEXT: `Listen to all the hipster jams of space.`,
  JUKEX004TEXT: `Listening to Jukebox`,
