  RECYCLE001TEXT: `3rd Gen 02 Recycler`,
  RECYCLE002TEXT: `A more robust O2 Recycler with a relatively small chance of a catastrophic failure. Relatively.`,
  RECYCLE003TEXT: `The 3rd Generation of Oxygen Recyclers, which were popular back in the early 230th Century, allowed more crew to be present on board.`,
  RECYCLE004TEXT: `4th Gen O2 Recycler`,
  RECYCLE005TEXT: `The best on the market. Removed pointless safety features in favor of more Jiggawatts.`,
  RECYCLE006TEXT: `The best generation of Oxygen Recyclers that allowed all carbon based life forms to breathe.`,
