  WEP01TEXT: `Stun Gloves`,
  WEP02TEXT: `These gloves shock the crap out of everything`,
  WEP03TEXT: `VibroKnife (TM)`,
  WEP04TEXT: `Known for its catch phrase 'For when your knife just doesn't vibrate enough.' this weapon has been in use since even before the post-collapse era`,
  WEP05TEXT: `Bad-Guy MiniBlaster (TM)`,
  WEP06TEXT: `You want to look intimidating? You want to look evil? well , this gun is for you, because its lasers are red and red equals evil.-Syndi-co`,
  WEP07TEXT: `Bad-Guy BigBlaster (TM)`,
  WEP08TEXT: `This gun is evil to the extreme! Is it intimidating? YES, is it RED, hell yes, buy it now.-Syndi-co`,
  WEP09TEXT: `Sniper Rifle OF EVIL (TM)`,
  WEP10TEXT: `The perfect sniper for your various assassination and pillaging based needs, its lasers are also RED!-Syndi-co.`,
  WEP11TEXT: `Fast-Phazer Of EVIL (TM)`,
  WEP12TEXT: `An fully Automatic Phazer, with red lasers of course -Syndi-co`,
  WEP13TEXT: `Nebuliser`,
  WEP14TEXT: `Once a remedy for those who crossed the streams, now amped and tweaked to transfigure to a another dimension.`,
  WEP15TEXT: `Sling of Truth`,
  WEP16TEXT: `Wield absolute truth into the minds' eye. Heals oneself of converse implications and logical injunctions.`,
  WEP17TEXT: `Plasmatron`,
  WEP18TEXT: `P.A.L.C. sanctioned with over three years of unabated R&D at Castor&Pollux for electrifying foes.`,
  WEP19TEXT: `Derezzer`,
  WEP20TEXT: `Simply put, it nullifies data (or matter) into the bit-bucket. Once present then fading into a etherial cloud of stardust.`,
  WEP21TEXT: `CryoVise`,
  WEP22TEXT: `Brought to you by FutureTech, this is a subset of the X-1 armour line which permits a 99% endothermic reaction -- a micrometer from a frozen turd.`,
  WEP23TEXT: `Rey5w0rd`,
  WEP24TEXT: `Unleash your inner L337dom, dispatch lamers, luzers, noobs and script kiddies. Hacks them to bits.`,
  WEP25TEXT: `TeleMag44`,
  WEP26TEXT: `No time for idlers, freebooters or raiders? Free your self from hysteria with the solid assurance to truly reach out and touch someone.`,
  WEP27TEXT: `Uberfist`,
  WEP28TEXT: `Amazing simple party favor gone bad. It's easy to control and eliminates embarassing slips and boosts cred.`,
  WEP29TEXT: `Schizodestroyer`,
  WEP30TEXT: `Tired of worrying, fearing losing your mind over some debacle? Seek and ye shall pacify.`,
  WEP31TEXT: `Sonicdirk`,
  WEP32TEXT: `A long thrusting .. powerful oscillator .. a sidearm of the officer class, that rips apart molecular bonds.`,
  WEP33TEXT: `Phazer Pistol`,
  WEP34TEXT: `For causing intentional or unintentional damage to people, objects, and critical space-facing walls.`,
  WEP35TEXT: `Megaphazer`,
  WEP36TEXT: `Designed to exterminate organic life.`,
  WEP37TEXT: `Phazer Rifle`,
  WEP38TEXT: `More effective than the Phazer Pistol in the hands of trained personnel.`,
  WEP39TEXT: `Hyper-Phaze Hand Cannon`,
  WEP40TEXT: `Damages the bejeepers out of any target. The pinnacle of Pre-Collapse weapons tech.`,
  WEP41TEXT: `Stunner`,
  WEP42TEXT: `Stuns target instead of killing it. Still kinda hurts though.`,
  WEP43TEXT: `Super Stunner`,
  WEP44TEXT: `Stuns target more effectively. Will totally mess up your hairdo.`,
