  WORMSTAGE101: `Is it just me, or did anyone else hear a voice telling them to 'Spread' in /CURRENTROOM/ `,
  WORMSTAGE102: `Hey guys, I think I heard someone talking to me just now..but there was no one around, do we have ghosts or something?`,
  WORMSTAGE103: `I feel like I just saw a ghost. `,
  WORMSTAGE104: `Hey guys..something really freaky is going on here...`,
  WORMSTAGE105: `I have this pounding headache and it isn't going away...`,
  WORMSTAGE106: `I'm sure I'm fine, I don't need to see a doctor.`,
  WORMSTAGE107: `I am not crazy I swear.`,
  WORMSTAGE108: `I feel as though I am being watched.`,
  WORMSTAGE109: `I swear I just heard someone call out my name in /CURRENTROOM/. Someone trying to prank me or something?`,
  WORMSTAGE110: `This isn't funny guys, who is messing with me?? :( `,
  WORMSTAGE111: `Someone was talking to me just now in /CURRENTROOM/ I couldn't see them, but they seemed pretty cool.`,
  WORMSTAGE112: `Why do I suddenly have an interest in worms...what the heck is wrong with me.`,
  WORMSTAGE201: `I knew I wasn't crazy, I'm the chosen one, listen to my words! `,
  WORMSTAGE202: `Hey everyone, I've been enlightened..it told me everything.`,
  WORMSTAGE203: `I will spread the word.... I will do it for you!`,
  WORMSTAGE204: `Whoever doesn't have a big ol worm in their brain needs one now, these things are the best..so loyal, so funny...I must spread...SPREAD THE WORM!`,
  WORMSTAGE205: `I used to have headaches...but now all I feel is ecstasy!`,
  WORMSTAGE206: `I don't need a doctor..the doctor needs me.`,
  WORMSTAGE207: `Hahaha..wormy you are the best.`,
  WORMSTAGE208: `My worm buddy just told me an awesome joke, you guys wouldn't get it though.`,
  WORMSTAGE209: `I was just told to 'Spread the true word' by a worm who lives in my brain, it even said I would get an 'Eternal reward' if I did do it, I'm totally doing it.  I wonder if the reward is candy? `,
  WORMSTAGE210: `Too Happy for words right now.`,
  WORMSTAGE211: `Heh, I just told someone the good news... my worm gave me candy for it.`,
  WORMSTAGE212: `Haha, these worms are the best!`,
  WORMSTAGE213: `Dude, I have a worm in my brain, you should get one!`,
  WORMSTAGE214: `Why would you refuse to have a worm in your brain, I don't get it.`,
  WORMSTAGE215: `Hey guys, guess what, I have a worm, I've always wanted a worm.`,
